request.description:
POST /api/wishlists/{customerId}/products/{productId}

Adds a product to the customer's wishlist.

Response: 201 Created (empty body).

DELETE /api/wishlists/{customerId}/products/{productId}

Removes a product from the customer's wishlist.

Response: 204 No Content.

DELETE /api/wishlists/{customerId}

Deletes the entire wishlist for a customer.

Response: 204 No Content.

GET /api/wishlists/{customerId}/products

Returns all products and notes for the customer's wishlist.

Response: 200 OK
```json
{
  "data": {
    "product_ids": ["product-1"],
    "product_notes": {
      "product-1": "buy-on-black-friday"
    }
  },
  "message": "Success",
  "statusCode": 200
}
```
